{"applicability_conditions":"适用于LDS表面形成并具有半导体特性的氧化膜；式中正负号取'+'对应n型半导体，取'−'对应p型半导体。由于空间电荷电容远小于Helmholtz电容，式(4)可简化为式(5)和式(6)。","identity":{"block_id":"b0060","equation_id":"equation_004","equation_number":"4","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\frac {1}{C _ {\\mathrm{H}} ^ {2}} + \\frac {1}{C _ {\\mathrm{SC}} ^ {2}} = \\pm \\frac {2}{\\varepsilon \\varepsilon_ {0} \\mathrm{eN}} \\left(E - E _ {\\mathrm{fb}} - \\frac {\\mathrm{kT}}{\\mathrm{e}}\\right)\\tag{4}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.corsci.2025.113331"},"latex":"\\frac{1}{C_{\\mathrm{H}}^{2}} + \\frac{1}{C_{\\mathrm{SC}}^{2}} = \\pm \\frac{2}{\\varepsilon \\varepsilon_{0} \\mathrm{eN}} \\left(E - E_{\\mathrm{fb}} - \\frac{\\mathrm{kT}}{\\mathrm{e}}\\right)","purpose":"定量描述LDS表面氧化膜的半导体特性（Mott-Schottky关系），将Helmholtz双电层电容与空间电荷层电容同外加电位联系起来，用于评价氧化膜载流子浓度（缺陷密度）。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"Helmholtz双电层电容","symbol":"C_{\\mathrm{H}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"氧化膜的空间电荷层电容","symbol":"C_{\\mathrm{SC}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"半导体的相对介电常数","symbol":"\\varepsilon","unit":null,"value":"15.6"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"真空介电常数","symbol":"\\varepsilon_0","unit":"F/m","value":"8.85 \\times 10^{-12} \\mathrm{F/m}"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"电子电荷","symbol":"\\mathrm{e}","unit":"C","value":"1.6 \\times 10^{-19} \\mathrm{C}"},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"载流子密度（N_D为n型半导体对应的施主密度，N_A为p型半导体对应的受主密度）","symbol":"N","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"玻尔兹曼常数","symbol":"k","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"绝对温度","symbol":"T","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"外加电位","symbol":"E","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"平带电位","symbol":"E_{\\mathrm{fb}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"正负号：'+'对应n型半导体，'−'对应p型半导体","symbol":"\\pm","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":[]}